<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":| ^ ski =\n    | I\n    | K\n    | S\n    | App : ski * ski\n\n:= ^ eval ski =\n    ?= ski ?|\n    | App (App (K, x), y) => x |> eval\n    | App (App (App (S, x), y), z) => App (App (x, z), App (y, z)) |> eval\n    | App (I, x) => x |> eval\n    | App (K, x) => App (K, eval x)\n    | App (f, x) => App (eval f, x) |> eval\n    | _ => ski","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :| ^ ski =
      | I
      | K
      | S
      | App : ski * ski

  := ^ eval ski =
      ?= ski ?|
      | App (App (K, x), y) => x |> eval
      | App (App (App (S, x), y), z) => App (App (x, z), App (y, z)) |> eval
      | App (I, x) => x |> eval
      | App (K, x) => App (K, eval x)
      | App (f, x) => App (eval f, x) |> eval
      | _ => ski
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### ski (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n\neval I\n|> _assert_eq I\n\nApp (I, I)\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq I\n\nApp (I, App (I, I))\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq I","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol

  eval I
  |> _assert_eq I

  App (I, I)
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq I

  App (I, App (I, I))
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq I
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### ski_identity_nested (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n\nApp (App (I, I), I)\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq I\n\nApp (App (App (I, I), I), I)\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq I","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol

  App (App (I, I), I)
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq I

  App (App (App (I, I), I), I)
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq I
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### ski_constant (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n\neval K\n|> _assert_eq K\n\nApp (K, I)\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq (App (K, I))\n\nApp (K, K)\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq (App (K, K))","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol

  eval K
  |> _assert_eq K

  App (K, I)
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq (App (K, I))

  App (K, K)
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq (App (K, K))
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### ski_constant_applied (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n\nApp (App (K, I), K)\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq I\n\nApp (App (K, K), I)\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq K\n\nApp (App (App (App (K, K), I), S), K)\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq S","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol

  App (App (K, I), K)
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq I

  App (App (K, K), I)
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq K

  App (App (App (App (K, K), I), S), K)
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq S
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

