#### ski_substitution_nested (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n\nApp (App (App (S, K), I), (App (App (K, I), S)))\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq I\n\nApp (App (K, S), App (I, App (App (App (S, K), S), I)))\n|> eval\n|> _assert_eq S","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol

  App (App (App (S, K), I), (App (App (K, I), S)))
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq I

  App (App (K, S), App (I, App (App (App (S, K), S), I)))
  |> eval
  |> _assert_eq S
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

